{"3625350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Re.dive Wonderland", "steam_appid": 3625350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/db63d2fdbc8317753de8bd5b2b8daffc.avif?t=1773997168\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/c1838380a642971cc70279b06a731d2b.avif?t=1773997168\" width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📢【Game Introduction】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ The protagonist ends an ordinary day and falls asleep—<br>Only to awaken in a strange, unfamiliar prison, not their usual room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With memories still hazy and a monster in pursuit, death seems inevitable—<br>Until four strangers appear before them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is then that the protagonist realizes:<br>This place is the world of an RPG game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Welcome to the world of 《Time in Wonderland》!</i><br><br><i>You have been chosen as the hero who will save Wonderland from the tyrant, the Heart Queen.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📢【System Overview】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >『Re.dive Wonderland』 is an otome game where two parts alternate:<br>A <strong>pixel-art style mystery adventure and minigame</strong> segment that the player can control directly,<br>and a <strong>visual novel</strong> part rich in story and emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices may lead you on a journey toward the truth of the world,<br>or guide you straight into unexpected bad endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every story is shaped by the choices <strong>you</strong> make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 𝐂𝐇𝐀𝐑𝐀𝐂𝐓𝐄𝐑 𝟬𝟭 ♦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/66b6eb05b37fe205f9c6ac419c5fbedd.avif?t=1773997168\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist of the story: <strong>Carol</strong><br>(*Name can be changed)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;If this is all just a dream... do I even want to wake up?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/14f78094e1af1c3926b57187577d8dc6.avif?t=1773997168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras_big/14f78094e1af1c3926b57187577d8dc6.avif?t=1773997168 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 𝐂𝐇𝐀𝐑𝐀𝐂𝐓𝐄𝐑 𝟬𝟮 ♦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/510a6959f6e4d3345bc16f2ff24c2675.avif?t=1773997168\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cheerful mood-maker: <strong>Raven</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Relax and enjoy it. We've got your back.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/0406a6f749b398df2f73495637b5eef9.avif?t=1773997168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras_big/0406a6f749b398df2f73495637b5eef9.avif?t=1773997168 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 𝐂𝐇𝐀𝐑𝐀𝐂𝐓𝐄𝐑 𝟬𝟯 ♦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/898744eecd5e9eee2d896bcb7a6a98e8.avif?t=1773997168\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gentle prince with a warm smile: <strong>Setsu</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;No matter what you choose, it’s all part of the path to the happiest ending.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/1f09f93088555aff914e37f2b81a3cc6.avif?t=1773997168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras_big/1f09f93088555aff914e37f2b81a3cc6.avif?t=1773997168 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 𝐂𝐇𝐀𝐑𝐀𝐂𝐓𝐄𝐑 𝟬𝟰 ♦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/e85b70909d69d57842f0ae0f6b4cf4e8.avif?t=1773997168\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unpredictable rebel: <strong>Noah</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;So all it takes is saving you to earn your trust? That’s... surprisingly easy.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/7f1d078878e83a1f7ae822258ece774f.avif?t=1773997168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras_big/7f1d078878e83a1f7ae822258ece774f.avif?t=1773997168 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 𝐂𝐇𝐀𝐑𝐀𝐂𝐓𝐄𝐑 𝟬𝟱 ♦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/732172397dd7a79152acb0344453f760.avif?t=1773997168\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enigmatic guide of this otherworld: <strong>Yuri</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Just remember—someone who can help you is always nearby.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/a5e3dc9b6fca805b45aac62bfa920772.avif?t=1773997168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras_big/a5e3dc9b6fca805b45aac62bfa920772.avif?t=1773997168 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/db63d2fdbc8317753de8bd5b2b8daffc.avif?t=1773997168\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/c1838380a642971cc70279b06a731d2b.avif?t=1773997168\" width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📢【Game Introduction】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ The protagonist ends an ordinary day and falls asleep—<br>Only to awaken in a strange, unfamiliar prison, not their usual room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With memories still hazy and a monster in pursuit, death seems inevitable—<br>Until four strangers appear before them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is then that the protagonist realizes:<br>This place is the world of an RPG game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Welcome to the world of 《Time in Wonderland》!</i><br><br><i>You have been chosen as the hero who will save Wonderland from the tyrant, the Heart Queen.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📢【System Overview】</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >『Re.dive Wonderland』 is an otome game where two parts alternate:<br>A <strong>pixel-art style mystery adventure and minigame</strong> segment that the player can control directly,<br>and a <strong>visual novel</strong> part rich in story and emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices may lead you on a journey toward the truth of the world,<br>or guide you straight into unexpected bad endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every story is shaped by the choices <strong>you</strong> make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 𝐂𝐇𝐀𝐑𝐀𝐂𝐓𝐄𝐑 𝟬𝟭 ♦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/66b6eb05b37fe205f9c6ac419c5fbedd.avif?t=1773997168\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist of the story: <strong>Carol</strong><br>(*Name can be changed)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;If this is all just a dream... do I even want to wake up?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/14f78094e1af1c3926b57187577d8dc6.avif?t=1773997168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras_big/14f78094e1af1c3926b57187577d8dc6.avif?t=1773997168 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦ 𝐂𝐇𝐀𝐑𝐀𝐂𝐓𝐄𝐑 𝟬𝟮 ♦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/510a6959f6e4d3345bc16f2ff24c26